yers around the world.What's newAdded Graphics Quality settings — Adjust the visual quality to better suit your system.Improved performance — Various optimizations should make the journey smoother across a wider range of hardware (including Steam Deck).Added Master Audio Level control — You can now adjust t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T19:03:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067927171","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2600820-1842212951297746","game_id":"steam-2600820","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo of The Journey Home is now live!","summary":"We’re excited to announce that the official demo for The Journey Home is here! As a small husband-and-wife team, this is a big milestone for us. We hope you’ll enjoy taking your first steps on this journey.The demo also includes subtitles in English, Dutch, German, Spanish (Spain), Portuguese (Brazil), and French, with more languages to be added in future updates.Although playing with a controller is recommended for the best gameplay experience, keyboard support is available, with expanded keybo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T17:55:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951297746","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:23:09Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2600820-1841579228668125","game_id":"steam-2600820","kind":"announcement","title":"Join our Discord for updates, playtests, and more","summary":"Want to follow The Journey Home more closely? Join us on Discord!It’s the best place to keep up with development, take part in playtests, report bugs, and chat with us and other players. We’d love to have you there! ❤️Join our Discord: https://discord.gg